1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
San Lucas, Kapitulo 18

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:07,400
Sinarita ni Jesus kadakwada daytoy apang ngari,

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:11,200
tapno isuro na ida amasapol ng agkararagda akanayon,

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,640
kandida pukawan, tinamnamada.

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,180
Kinunan ni Jesus,

6
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:19,020
Adda idimay sa ahwes, itimay sa ngaili.

7
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:24,220
Saan nga agbutang iti Diyos, katawan raraaman na atao.

8
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:28,900
Addamat may sa abalo ababai, itiday tamatlaang ngaili.

9
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,980
Masansan amapan itihwes akon ko nana.

10
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:37,880
Tulungan na kadi amang tonton itikalintagak itikabusur ko.

11
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,420
Nabayag ading kaskaso itihwes.

12
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:45,800
Ngayom kamaudyanan na, kinunan na itibagina.

13
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,860
Nupay nujak agbutang iti Diyos,

14
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,180
kanawan raraamag atao.

15
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:55,100
Ngayom gapo tamauma akon asingsingaan daytoy abalo,

16
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,040
itad kumanlaangan tidaudawatan na.

17
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:02,700
Nusaan, di nagtusardangan aring ringguren,

18
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,980
kat maibuston ti anus ko.

19
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,800
Intuloy ti apo,

20
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:10,240
nang ngegyo tiki nunatidakis ahwes,

21
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:14,780
kat dinto ay atulungan ti Diyos dagit itatao na

22
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:18,220
nga umasasog ken kwa na itialdaw ken rabi'i.

23
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,520
Di nanto kadidardarasin titumulong kadakwada,

24
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,380
ibagak kadakayo,

25
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:28,140
adagdagusin nanto nga ipaay kadakwada ti hustisya,

26
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:30,980
ngayom inton umay ti anak ti tao,

27
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:34,780
at danto nga tamasarakan na apamati dito'y daga?

28
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:38,980
Sinarita pa'y ni Jesus daytoy apang ngarig kadagay ti tatao,

29
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:41,580
amang itang tangsit itikinaimbagda,

30
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:44,200
ganmang uly-uyaw kadagay ti sabsabalik.

31
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:48,260
At dadwa alalaki anapan nagkararag ijay templo,

32
00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:50,480
may sa'ti fariseyo,

33
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:53,360
may sa'ti agsingsingir itibuis,

34
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:57,140
nagtakder ti fariseyo itinapak ni alugar,

35
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:57,200
kat itinapak ni alugar,

36
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,260
kat inkararag na asi uulimek,

37
00:02:00,980 --> 00:02:03,100
agyamanak ken ka o Diyos,

38
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:07,180
tas sa anak akas kadagay ti daduma anaagom,

39
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:08,800
na ulbod,

40
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:11,080
wen no makikam kamalala,

41
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,660
agyamanak met,

42
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:16,860
tas sa anak akas itidaytoy nga agsingsingir itibuis.

43
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:21,220
Mamindwaak nga agayonar tunggal lawas,

44
00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:24,140
kat itedko ti apagkapullo,

45
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,360
ti amin amasapulak.

46
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:30,280
Ngayon nagtakder itaadayo ti agsingsingir itibuis,

47
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:34,180
kat di napay itangad dagitimata na sa dilangit.

48
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:38,820
Dinandanog na kitditi barukong na kat kinunkunana,

49
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:43,120
O Diyos, kasiyan na kadi aminagbasol?

50
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,660
Kinunan, Jesus.

51
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:46,880
Ibagak kada kayo,

52
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:52,520
nagawid ti agsingsingir itibuis anapalintag itisangwanan ti Diyos.

53
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,520
Ngayon ti fariseyo,

54
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,840
saan anapalintag?

55
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,260
Tatimangitan tanok itibagina.

56
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,100
Maipababan to,

57
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:03,560
ngam timangipababa itibagina.

58
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,360
Maitanok to.

59
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:09,360
Adda sumagmamano at attao anang iyag kadagitiiii ubbing da,

60
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:12,780
tap noipatay ni Jesus ti ima na kadakwada.

61
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:16,280
Nakita dagiti adalan kat inong tanda i da,

62
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,220
itikasta nga inaramig da.

63
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,300
Ngayon inayaban ni Jesus dagiti ubing.

64
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,820
Kit kinunanan?

65
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:26,140
Palubusan nyo dagiti ubing nga umay kanya.

66
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:48,060
Nagsaludsood ka ni Jesus

67
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:50,140
timay sa apanguluan ahudyo.

68
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:52,000
Naimbag ang maestro?

69
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,420
Kinunana?

70
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:56,420
Anya ti aramidek tap no magunood ko

71
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,800
tibiyag nagnanayon?

72
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,360
Kinunan Jesus?

73
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:26,620
Sipod pa'y idiubingak

74
00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:29,480
tinungtong palko amin dagitoy abilin.

75
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,480
Insungbati lalaki,

76
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,940
idi mang ngagdaytoy ni Jesus,

77
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:34,880
kinunana?

78
00:04:35,620 --> 00:04:37,460
At dapay may saapagkurangam.

79
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,180
Ilakom amin asanikwam,

80
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,600
samo ited kadagitinapanglaw tinaglakwam,

81
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,680
kat at danto kinabak ng mongos sa dilangit.

82
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,180
Kalpasan na,

83
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:50,540
umay ka sumurot kanyak.

84
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,740
Ngam nagladinga titao,

85
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:54,000
uidimang ngagnadaytoy,

86
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:56,680
agsipod taado ti sanikwana,

87
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,440
nakita ni Jesus

88
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,860
tili day ti baknang.

89
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:02,380
Nagrigat kit din asumrek

90
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:04,700
dagitinabaknang itipagarian ti Diyos.

91
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,360
Kinunana?

92
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,740
Nalaklakat ti ilulusot

93
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:11,100
timay sa akamelyo itiabot ti dagom,

94
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,960
ngam ti isasarek

95
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:15,120
tibaknang itipagarian ti Diyos.

96
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:16,720
Nangagdagitit

97
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,560
at tao ti kinunani Jesus.

98
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,480
Siya sino nga roodin

99
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,520
ti maisalakan?

100
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:24,180
Arood sodda?

101
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,640
Ti saan ang mabalin

102
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,640
kada gititat tao?

103
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,640
Mabalin iti Diyos.

104
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,640
Insumbat ni Jesus,

105
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:33,640
kinunang arood ni Pedro.

106
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,640
At toy,

107
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,640
binaybayan mi dagit ibalbalay mi

108
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,640
kat simurot kamikin ka.

109
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,640
When?

110
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,640
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada.

111
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,640
Ibagakdaytoy kadakayo,

112
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:47,640
ti siya sino man

113
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,640
anang panaw itibalay,

114
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,640
asawa a babae,

115
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,740
kakaibigan,

116
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:53,440
kakapsat,

117
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,940
alalaki,

118
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:56,140
naganak,

119
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,240
wen noan naknag

120
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,440
kapo itipagarian ti Diyos,

121
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,940
at adunto nga adayo

122
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:03,540
ti awaten na ditoy abyag.

123
00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:06,140
Ket itimasakbayan,

124
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:09,240
biyag nga agnanayon.

125
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,540
Inyadayo ni Jesus

126
00:06:10,540 --> 00:06:11,540
dagiti sa nga pulog

127
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:13,240
at dwa nga adalan

128
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,540
ket kinunan na kadakwada.

129
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:17,940
Denggan nyo,

130
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:18,940
sumang at tay

131
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:20,740
ijay Jerusalem,

132
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:22,240
ket matumpal to sa djay

133
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,740
iti aming nga insursurat

134
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:25,040
dagiti profeta

135
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:28,040
maipapan iti anak ti tao.

136
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,940
Mayawat to kadagiti hentil

137
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,540
amangang angaw,

138
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:33,240
mang pabpabain,

139
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:36,540
ken mang toptop ranto ken kwana.

140
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:37,540
Sapliten,

141
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:40,240
ken papatayin dan to.

142
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,640
Ngam agungar to

143
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,840
iti maikatlong aldaw.

144
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,440
Awan na pulos kadagitoy

145
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,940
tinaawatan dagiti adalan,

146
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:49,340
nailinged kadakwada

147
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:51,840
at kaipapanan dagiti balikas na,

148
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,840
kat didaam mo

149
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:56,040
noon niya tisasawan ni Jesus.

150
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,640
Idi asidigan ni Jesus

151
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,340
ijay Jericho,

152
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:00,840
at damaysa a bulsok

153
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,040
ng agtugtugaw

154
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,040
ken agpal palama

155
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,940
itiigid tidalan,

156
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:06,640
nang ngagnadagiti ta tao

157
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,540
ngaglabas

158
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:09,440
kat sinaludsod na,

159
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,340
Apay,

160
00:07:10,340 --> 00:07:11,640
anya dayta?

161
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,940
Lumabas ni Jesus

162
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:14,540
at aga nasarit.

163
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:15,240
Kinunadak,

164
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,340
hedkwana,

165
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,440
itikasta,

166
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:19,340
impukaw ti bulsok.

167
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:21,340
Jesus nga anak ni David,

168
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:23,240
kaasyan na kadi.

169
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,340
Inuntan dagiti adda itisango

170
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:26,740
kat imbagada kenkwana

171
00:07:26,740 --> 00:07:28,040
ng agulimot.

172
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:28,540
Ngayon,

173
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,940
inyadadda na kitdi

174
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:31,640
tinanggipukaw.

175
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,640
Anak ni David,

176
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,940
kaasyan na kadi.

177
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,640
Nagsardang narood ni Jesus

178
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,840
kat imbilin na

179
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,240
ay asidig da kenkwana

180
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,340
ti bulsok.

181
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:43,140
Idin ay asidigan

182
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,240
sinaludsod ni Jesus

183
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,640
kenkwana.

184
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,140
Anya ti kayat mga aramid

185
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,340
da kenka?

186
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:49,640
Apo.

187
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,240
Kinunadak ti bulsok.

188
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:51,940
Kayat ko

189
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:54,140
ang makakita ak kuma.

190
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,940
Makakita ka.

191
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:58,040
Insumbat ni Jesus.

192
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,140
Tipang matim

193
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:01,340
tinang paimbag kenka.

194
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:02,640
Dagos ang makakita

195
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:03,940
ang ti bulsok.

196
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,140
Simurod ka ni Jesus

197
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:06,240
kat inday dayaw na

198
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,640
ti Diyos.

199
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,540
Idimakita dagit

200
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:10,640
itatao tinapasama

201
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,440
inday dayaw

202
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,440
damat ti Diyos.

